---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About Us"
  description="Learn about ebin's mission to keep electronic waste out of Bengaluru's lakes and landfills through certified, doorstep recycling."
>
  
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-charcoal-900 text-white relative">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-4">
      <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-eco-400 bg-charcoal-800 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-charcoal-700">
        Our Mission
      </span>
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-6xl font-black tracking-tight text-white">
        Closing the loop on electronics in India’s Tech Capital.
      </h1>
      <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-charcoal-300 leading-relaxed">
        ebin was founded with a singular purpose: to make responsible electronic recycling effortless, transparent, and ubiquitous across Bengaluru.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- The Bengaluru Crisis Section -->
  <section class="py-24 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center">
        
        <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-6">
          <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-eco-600 bg-eco-50 px-3 py-1 rounded-full">
            The Reality
          </span>
          <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-charcoal-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">
            Bengaluru generates over 50,000 tons of e-waste each year.
          </h2>
          <p class="text-charcoal-700 text-base leading-relaxed">
            As the Silicon Valley of India, Bengaluru leads the nation in technological innovation. But with every smartphone upgrade, laptop replacement, and retired office server, mountains of hazardous e-waste are generated.
          </p>
          <p class="text-charcoal-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Over 85% of this waste historically flows into unorganized scrap markets, where primitive open-air burning and acid leaching poison local water tables, release toxic lead and mercury vapors, and endanger the health of vulnerable informal workers.
          </p>
          <p class="text-charcoal-700 text-base font-semibold">
            ebin changes that paradigm entirely. We bridge households, apartment complexes, and offices directly with licensed, scientific dismantling and recovery facilities.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="lg:col-span-5 bg-charcoal-900 text-white rounded-3xl p-8 shadow-xl space-y-6">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-black text-white border-b border-charcoal-800 pb-4">
            Our 3 Core Pillars
          </h3>

          <div class="space-y-4">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-eco-500 text-charcoal-900 font-black text-xs flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">1</span>
              <div>
                <h4 class="font-bold text-sm text-white">Frictionless Convenience</h4>
                <p class="text-xs text-charcoal-300 mt-0.5">No dragging heavy monitors to obscure industrial yards. We come right to your door.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-eco-500 text-charcoal-900 font-black text-xs flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">2</span>
              <div>
                <h4 class="font-bold text-sm text-white">100% Zero-Landfill Assurance</h4>
                <p class="text-xs text-charcoal-300 mt-0.5">Zero hazardous residue reaches BBMP landfills or water bodies. Ever.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-eco-500 text-charcoal-900 font-black text-xs flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">3</span>
              <div>
                <h4 class="font-bold text-sm text-white">Full Regulatory Rigor</h4>
                <p class="text-xs text-charcoal-300 mt-0.5">Operating strictly under CPCB E-Waste Management Rules with KSPCB authorized recyclers.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Environmental Impact Highlights -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-charcoal-50 border-t border-charcoal-200">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      
      <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-16">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-black text-charcoal-900 tracking-tight">
          Why Recycling Matters in Numbers
        </h2>
        <p class="text-charcoal-600 text-sm mt-2">
          When you hand over your devices to ebin, you save virgin earth from destructive mining.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-charcoal-200 shadow-sm text-center space-y-3">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-eco-50 text-eco-700 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl mx-auto">
            🥇
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-black text-charcoal-900">Gold & Rare Earths</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-charcoal-600 leading-relaxed">
            One metric ton of recycled smartphone circuit boards contains up to <strong>300 grams of gold</strong> — nearly 50 times richer than mined ore.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-charcoal-200 shadow-sm text-center space-y-3">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-eco-50 text-eco-700 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl mx-auto">
            🛡️
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-black text-charcoal-900">Toxic Heavy Metal Sequestration</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-charcoal-600 leading-relaxed">
            Safe dismantling seals away mercury from backlights, cadmium from older chips, and lead solder from contaminating Karnataka's aquifers.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-charcoal-200 shadow-sm text-center space-y-3">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-eco-50 text-eco-700 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl mx-auto">
            🔄
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-black text-charcoal-900">True Circular Production</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-charcoal-600 leading-relaxed">
            Copper, high-grade plastics, and aluminum recovered in our partner centers return directly into clean manufacturing cycles.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA Banner -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-eco-600 text-white text-center">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-6">
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black tracking-tight">Be part of Bengaluru’s clean tech future.</h2>
      <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-eco-100 max-w-xl mx-auto">
        Whether you have a single broken phone or an entire office server room to clear, we’re here to help.
      </p>
      <div class="pt-2">
        <a
          href="/pickup/"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-9 py-4 rounded-full text-base font-black text-charcoal-900 bg-white hover:bg-charcoal-100 transition-colors shadow-xl"
        >
          Book Doorstep Pickup
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
